REM Caps Lock sync demo (hosts that mirror Caps LED).
DELAY 2000
IF_WIN
GUI r
DELAY 1000
STRING notepad
ENTER
DELAY 1200
STRINGLN CAPS SYNC DEMO
STRINGLN Turn Caps Lock ON to continue...
WAIT_FOR_CAPS_ON
STRINGLN Caps detected ON.
STRINGLN Turn Caps Lock OFF to finish...
WAIT_FOR_CAPS_OFF
STRINGLN Caps detected OFF. Demo complete.
END_IF
IF_LINUX
CTRL ALT t
DELAY 1200
STRINGLN echo CAPS SYNC DEMO
STRINGLN echo Turn Caps Lock ON...
WAIT_FOR_CAPS_ON
STRINGLN echo Caps ON
STRINGLN echo Turn Caps Lock OFF...
WAIT_FOR_CAPS_OFF
STRINGLN echo Caps OFF done
END_IF
